# Inputs and outputs are in the notation of docs/domains/memory/page-tables/contract.md, Legacy test vectors, with the forms of the vector notation of docs/domains/memory/page-tables/specification.md; each expected output is that of the contract's row.
# A case is one call of an entry that the test makes with the output that it asserts: sets= the sets of the test, do= its earlier calls and writes, call= the call, ask= what the test asserts of the state after it.
